</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Edron Peninsula surface\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"154\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Edron_Peninsula_surface_8479a3.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">6.4<br/>November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThis area is west of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> castle.  It can be reached through an underground passage accessible in the cellar of the south-west tower of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> Castle.\n</p><p>This is a good hunting area for characters starting their adventuring career in <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>.\n</p><p>On the north side of the peninsula is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Troll</a> cave which is home to the <a href=\"#/quest/troll-cave-quest\">Edron Troll Quest</a>.\n</p><p>On the south side of the peninsula is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin\">Goblin</a> cave with the <a href=\"#/quest/edron-goblin-quest\">Edron Goblin Quest</a>.  There is also a large <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">White Mushroom</a> daily spawn inside the cave.\n</p><p>On the west end, there is a single tunnel called the <a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Mines\">Lost Mines</a> which is part of the <a href=\"#/quest/sea-of-light-quest\">Sea of Light Quest</a>.\n</p><p>For more information about these caves see:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Troll%20Cave\">Edron Troll Cave</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Goblin%20Cave\">Edron Goblin Cave</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Mines\">Lost Mines</a></li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Surface Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Butterfly%20%28Purple%29\"><img alt=\"Butterfly (Purple)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Butterfly_Purple_4bdd3e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Butterfly%20%28Purple%29\">Butterfly (Purple)</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table no-results\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>This creature drops no loot.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Seagull\"><img alt=\"Seagull\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Seagull_bfde69.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Seagull\">Seagull</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0<